\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 4. How each CSV column is computed\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs24 \cf0 From 
\f4\fs26 scripts/lib/somatic_burden.py
\f2\fs24 :\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 total_variants, pass_variants, filter_*
\f2\b0  \'97 streamed from the VCF FILTER column (field 7). A multi-filter row increments 
\f7\i each
\f2\i0  named bucket once (plus 
\f4\fs26 filter_other
\f2\fs24  for any unnamed token), so filter columns can sum to more than 
\f4\fs26 total \uc0\u8722  PASS
\f2\fs24  by design.\
\ls2\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 coding_total, missense, synonymous (= MAF "Silent"), nonsense, frameshift_*, in_frame_*, splice_*
\f2\b0  \'97 counted from the MAF 
\f4\fs26 Variant_Classification
\f2\fs24  column. "Coding" = the 11 classes in 
\f4\fs26 CODING_CLASSES
\f2\fs24 .\
\ls2\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 sift_deleterious / tolerated / unknown
\f2\b0  \'97 MAF 
\f4\fs26 SIFT
\f2\fs24  prefix match ("deleterious\'85" / "tolerated\'85" / else unknown). Non-missense rows have no SIFT score and fall into 
\f4\fs26 unknown
\f2\fs24 , which is why 
\f4\fs26 sift_unknown
\f2\fs24  \uc0\u8776  total MAF rows.\
\ls2\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 gnomad_known / novel
\f2\b0  \'97 MAF 
\f4\fs26 gnomAD_AF
\f2\fs24 ; AF > 0.001 = known, else novel (
\f4\fs26 GNOMAD_NOVEL_THRESHOLD
\f2\fs24 ).\
\ls2\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 genes_with_any_variant / coding_variant
\f2\b0  \'97 unique 
\f4\fs26 Hugo_Symbol
\f2\fs24  sets.\
\ls2\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 tmb_mut_per_mb
\f2\b0  \'97 read directly from 
\f4\fs26 <SAMPLE>_tmb.tsv
\f2\fs24  (target_size 978,354,808 bp for all four; counts 409/346/66/49).\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

